  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AFK Auto Attack</Major>
    <Description>Are you tired of constant clicking spacebar to grind levels for next instance?

I present to you

An auto attack macro where delays are different lengths to confuse a potential check by the administration tools. 
Macro have a loop so all you have to do is turn it on and go do something when your character automatically kills nearby mobs and gains this sweet exp.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
